			dependencies: ["32FC6845A69FB70C"]
			description: [
				"The &6Meat Grinder&r processes items in Butchery's scrappable category into meat scraps. Check its accepted inputs before feeding it a valuable ingredient."
				""
				"With the right attachment it also handles sausages. It is a companion to the Mincer, rather than a replacement for it."
